        "source": "def poly(x, a, b, c):\n    return a * x + b * x * x + c * x * x * x\n\ndef contributions(values, a, b, c, g, mode):\n    out = []\n    total = 0\n    prev = 0\n    for i in range(len(values)):\n        x = values[i]\n        base = poly(x, a, b, c)\n        if mode == 0:\n            extra = g * x * prev\n        else:\n            extra = g * x * total\n        out.append(base + extra)\n        total = total + x\n        prev = x\n    return out\n\ndef cumsum_pass(lst):\n    out = []\n    s = 0\n    for v in lst:\n        s = s + v\n        out.append(s)\n    return out\n\ndef apply_passes(lst, n):\n    cur = lst\n    for _ in range(n):\n        cur = cumsum_pass(cur)\n    return cur\n\ndef evaluate(values, a, b, c, g, mode, passes):\n    if len(values) == 0:\n        return 0\n    contribs = contributions(values, a, b, c, g, mode)\n    result = apply_passes(contribs, passes)\n    return result[-1]\n\ndef search(values):\n    coeffs = [-2, -1, 0, 1, 2]\n    gs = [-2, -1, 1, 2]\n    best = None\n    for a in coeffs:\n        for b in coeffs:\n            for c in coeffs:\n                for g in gs:\n                    for mode in (0, 1):\n                        for passes in (1, 2, 3, 4):\n                            val = evaluate(values, a, b, c, g, mode, passes)\n                            if best is None or abs(val) < abs(best):\n                                best = val\n    return best\n\ndef investigate(context, acquire):\n    values = context[\"values\"]\n    if len(values) == 0:\n        return 0\n    return search(values)\n",
        "scope": "The source is a synthetic resettable integer sequence. The hidden generator applies a cubic polynomial p(x)=a*x+b*x*x+c*x*x*x with a,b,c in {-2,-1,0,1,2} to each value, optionally adds g*x times either the immediately preceding value or the cumulative sum of all preceding values, with g in {-2,-1,1,2}, then applies 1 to 4 cumulative-sum passes and returns the last entry. The empty sequence returns 0.",
